/agentcell

# THREE DEAD FILES, kept on disk and out of history [11 August 2026, with the repository split].
# verification/{archive,cli-output,mcp-stream}-overlay.json are leftovers from an earlier
# `go test -overlay` approach that mutant_checks.sh no longer uses — it copies fixtures into place
# and selects them with `-tags` instead. Verified unused: nothing in the tree passes `-overlay` or
# names these files.
#
# They are ignored rather than deleted because this tree had no history until today, so the working
# copy is the only record and deleting is the one edit that loses information. They are ignored
# rather than committed because each one hard-codes `/Users/akmo/agentcell/...`, and putting one
# operator's home directory into a PUBLIC repository's permanent history to preserve a file nothing
# reads is a bad trade in both directions.
/verification/*-overlay.json
